{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03274",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 2.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.43,
      "end_seconds": 9.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Of course, leave it it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.16,
      "end_seconds": 19.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Well, honestly, it's flakes on my shoulders, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.86,
      "end_seconds": 22.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.01,
      "end_seconds": 34.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "It's, It's been six months, I'm fairly sure. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.56,
      "end_seconds": 42.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "How much trouble does it it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.98,
      "end_seconds": 44.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.96,
      "end_seconds": 47.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.46,
      "end_seconds": 53.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "It usually comes with a little redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.3,
      "end_seconds": 57.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "has there been an itchy scalp too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.7,
      "end_seconds": 73.55,
      "duration_seconds": 14.85,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. With itchy scalp, severe, I'd say. Well, as for little redness, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.9,
      "end_seconds": 79.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "have you had any pain, hair loss or rash elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.64,
      "end_seconds": 84.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "No, um, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.39,
      "end_seconds": 87.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Has there been any pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.48,
      "end_seconds": 92.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any pus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.26,
      "end_seconds": 95.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.55,
      "end_seconds": 101.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.53,
      "end_seconds": 106.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Okay, any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.32,
      "end_seconds": 110.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.49,
      "end_seconds": 116.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.95,
      "end_seconds": 145.4,
      "duration_seconds": 28.45,
      "text": "I've had heart disease for five years now. I have an underactive thyroid, for five years. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. So, yes, acid reflux. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.8,
      "end_seconds": 157.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Right, so an underactive thyroid and acid reflux are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.32,
      "end_seconds": 181.68,
      "duration_seconds": 22.36,
      "text": "It's thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage. Lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast. Erm, I take an anti-dandruff shampoo, twice a week. I had clopidogrel at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.02,
      "end_seconds": 198.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.77,
      "end_seconds": 203.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.83,
      "end_seconds": 207.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.75,
      "end_seconds": 212.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.33,
      "end_seconds": 216.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.07,
      "end_seconds": 222.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.2,
      "end_seconds": 225.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.4,
      "end_seconds": 231.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.55,
      "end_seconds": 233.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.91,
      "end_seconds": 239.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.65,
      "end_seconds": 254.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.87,
      "end_seconds": 269.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.68,
      "end_seconds": 285.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 86, BP is 111 over 73, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.81,
      "end_seconds": 288.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.92,
      "end_seconds": 293.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "right, we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.1,
      "end_seconds": 299.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.47,
      "end_seconds": 303.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.27,
      "end_seconds": 317.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "There is fine greasy scaling across the scalp with no bald patches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.81,
      "end_seconds": 323.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.34,
      "end_seconds": 349.17,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this is probably simple dandruff. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. We shouldn't forget seborrhoeic dermatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.9,
      "end_seconds": 353.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.96,
      "end_seconds": 377.25,
      "duration_seconds": 22.29,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's simple dandruff, and we'll watch how it goes let's use ketoconazole shampoo, 2%, twice a week, four weeks it's for dandruff leave the shampoo on for five minutes before rinsing i'd like you back if not better in a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 377.94,
      "end_seconds": 382.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.78,
      "end_seconds": 388.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.45,
      "end_seconds": 391.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}